Sval: remove Firefox's zoom button from the address field

Sval shows the page's zoom in the site menu, as a slider. updateZoomUI
keeps the app menu's and the zoom widget's labels; the toolbox's click
and keypress handlers and the tooltip maps find no element under the id
and pass it by.

